    "id": "moby-dick-world",
    "name": "Moby-Dick; or, The Whale",
    "description": "Herman Melville’s sea epic follows Ishmael aboard the Nantucket whaleship Pequod, where Captain Ahab turns a global working voyage into an absolute pursuit of the white sperm whale that maimed him. Friendship, labor, belief, natural history, and the limits of interpretation gather around a ship driven toward the Pacific and its captain’s chosen end.",
