      "timelineId": "moby-dick-timeline-voyage",
      "number": 54,
      "title": "The Town-Ho's Story",
      "summary": "Ishmael relates how Radney's cruelty, Steelkilt's mutiny, and Moby Dick's intervention converge aboard another ship.",
